      "parameters": {
        "content": "ORDERS\nPrices and totals are recalculated here from the catalogue, so a tampered browser cannot change the price. Orders outside the delivery area are saved as needs_review. Create a Google Sheet tab 'Orders' with the headers from sheets/Orders.csv. WhatsApp messages need approved templates: order_confirmation (4 text variables).\nSet the values in the Config node (webhook key, Google Sheet ID, WhatsApp and Telegram details). The website sends the same key in the x-vaigai-key header. Credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, Telegram, OpenAI (assistant only). Nodes marked optional are disabled until you add credentials.",
